    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "By a chatbot"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Spring is an amazing season. Its arrival is celebrated by children and adults alike."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Spring is a season of new beginnings. As the days become longer and warmer, the Earth slowly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "comes back to life",
            "ref": "v-come-back-to-life"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Trees start to bud, and birds start to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "chirp",
            "zh": "吱喳叫"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The colourful flowers start to grow; their sweet smell fills the air."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For kids, spring is a time to go outside and be with friends. They can take part in all kinds of fun activities like biking, flying kites and learning about the different animals around them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Spring is a season of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "miracles",
            "zh": "奇迹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", as the world "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "renews",
            "ref": "v-renew"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " itself. It is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reminder",
            "ref": "v-reminder"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that life is full of hope and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "possibilities",
            "ref": "v-possibility"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is the perfect time for children to learn about the beauty of nature and its importance in our lives."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "By Larry White"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In Canada, my country, winter is long. For months, there is only a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dull",
            "ref": "v-dull"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "landscape",
            "zh": "景色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like an old photograph. Nature is quiet, sleeping, waiting. Then things begin to change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One week, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lawn",
            "zh": "草坪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in front of my house is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blanketed",
            "ref": "v-blanket"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with snow. The next week, the snow has become small white islands in a sea of green grass. As people "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "unwind"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their thick scarves, I begin to see many lovely smiling faces again, too."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is a nature path near my home. As I walk there, I can feel the Earth "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vibrate",
            "zh": "颤动"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Seeds are opening up and the new growth is pushing its way to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "surface",
            "ref": "v-surface"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In a week, perhaps two, the path will be a long carpet of tiny blue and yellow flowers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This is the miracle of spring. It is the miracle of new life and the miracle of new hope—hope for nature, for me, for all of us."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "AI-powered chatbots like ChatGPT look so smart! Will they put people out of work? Our staff writer Larry says no. He believes you will always like his articles more..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
